#: ../../source/reference/generated/transaction_costs/pams.ProportionalTransactionCost.rst:7
msgid "ProportionalTransactionCost"
msgstr "ProportionalTransactionCost"

#: of pams.transaction_costs.ProportionalTransactionCost:1
msgid "Proportional transaction cost class."
msgstr "比例取引コストクラス。"

#: of pams.transaction_costs.ProportionalTransactionCost:3
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Both the buyer and the seller of each execution pay ``rate`` times the "
"executed value (``price * volume``). The rate is set by \"rate\" in the "
"settings, e.g., ``{\"class\": \"ProportionalTransactionCost\", \"rate\": "
"0.001}`` for 0.1%."
msgstr ""
"各約定の買い手と売り手の双方が、約定金額（``price * volume``）の ``rate`` 倍を支払います。料率は設定の "
"\"rate\" で指定します（例：0.1% なら ``{\"class\": \"ProportionalTransactionCost\", "
"\"rate\": 0.001}``）。"

#: of pams.transaction_costs.ProportionalTransactionCost:8
msgid ":class:`pams.transaction_costs.TransactionCost`"
msgstr ":class:`pams.transaction_costs.TransactionCost`"

#: of pams.transaction_costs.ProportionalTransactionCost.compute_costs:1
msgid "Compute the transaction costs of an execution."
msgstr "約定の取引コストを計算します。"

#: ../../source/reference/generated/transaction_costs/pams.ProportionalTransactionCost.rst
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "パラメータ"

#: of pams.transaction_costs.ProportionalTransactionCost.compute_costs:4
msgid "executed price."
msgstr "約定価格。"

#: of pams.transaction_costs.ProportionalTransactionCost.compute_costs:7
msgid "executed volume."
msgstr "約定数量。"

#: of pams.transaction_costs.ProportionalTransactionCost.compute_costs:10
msgid "buy order (not used)."
msgstr "買い注文（未使用）。"

#: of pams.transaction_costs.ProportionalTransactionCost.compute_costs:13
msgid "sell order (not used)."
msgstr "売り注文（未使用）。"

#: ../../source/reference/generated/transaction_costs/pams.ProportionalTransactionCost.rst
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "戻り値"

#: of pams.transaction_costs.ProportionalTransactionCost.compute_costs:16
msgid ""
"transaction costs of the buyer and of the seller, both ``rate * price * "
"volume``."
msgstr "買い手と売り手の取引コスト。いずれも ``rate * price * volume`` です。"

#: ../../source/reference/generated/transaction_costs/pams.ProportionalTransactionCost.rst
msgid "Return type"
msgstr "戻り値の型"

#: of pams.transaction_costs.ProportionalTransactionCost.setup:1
msgid "Transaction cost setup. Usually be called from runner automatically."
msgstr "取引コストのセットアップ。通常はランナーから自動的に呼び出されます。"

#: of pams.transaction_costs.ProportionalTransactionCost.setup:4
msgid ""
"transaction cost configuration. Usually, automatically set from json "
"config of simulator. This must include the parameter \"rate\", a number "
"in [0.0, 1.0)."
msgstr ""
"取引コストの設定。通常はシミュレーターのJSON設定ファイルから自動的に設定されます。パラメータ \"rate\"（[0.0, 1.0) "
"の範囲の数値）を含める必要があります。"

#: of pams.transaction_costs.ProportionalTransactionCost.setup:9
#: pams.transaction_costs.ProportionalTransactionCost.setup:11
msgid "not used."
msgstr "未使用。"

